## Gotchas

- BMM `documentation` strings pass through bmm-publisher's `formatText()`: `{attr}` is escaped, so write literal values (e.g. `latest`, not `{base_release}`); same-document `<<_x_class,X>>` xrefs work; use `×`, not `*`.
{{/if}}

